** PRO/II Semantic Token Test File **

This file tests stream name highlighting in a PRO/II input file.

NAME ACI1       ,AIRCOOLER   ,AIR INLET   ,E1105       /*
     ACI2       ,AIRCOOLER   ,AIR INLET   ,E1106       /*
     ACI5       ,AIRCOOLER   ,AIR INLET   ,E1107       /*

$ STREAM DATA
PROP STRM=ACI1, TEMP=25, PRES=1.013
PROP STRM=ACI2, REFS=ACI1, RATE(W,KG/H)=764587.912
PROP STRM=ACI5, REFS=ACI1, RATE(W,KG/H)=624669.062

NAME USDP       ,ECPSI US7   ,DIESEL      ,PRODUCT     /*

$ ANOTHER SECTION  
PROP STRM=USDP, TEMP=50, PRES=2.0

**Expected behavior:**
- ACI1, ACI2, ACI5, USDP in PROP lines should be highlighted
- Stream names in NAME lines should NOT be highlighted (definitions, not references)
- Stream names in continuation lines should NOT be highlighted